{
  "name": "Parciva",
  "description": "Design tokens v4 'Acolhedor com Peso' — ver DESIGN.md. Base neutra papel/fundo/tinta/grafite, pastel de estado nomeado por processo, acento unico (#35D48A) so em pulso/CTA-IA. Compativel com tailwind.config.js (v3) via theme.extend.",
  "version": "4.0.0",
  "theme": {
    "extend": {
      "colors": {
        "surface": {
          "canvas": "#F7F6F3",
          "panel": "#EFEEEA",
          "card": "#FFFFFF",
          "raised": "#FFFFFF",
          "inverse": "#12140F"
        },
        "content": {
          "primary": "#12140F",
          "secondary": "#5C625F",
          "muted": "#9AA09C",
          "on-inverse": "#FFFFFF"
        },
        "line": {
          "hairline": "#E4E5E1",
          "strong": "#D2D4CE"
        },
        "state": {
          "open": "#5C625F",
          "open-pastel": "#F7F6F3",
          "review": "#9A6A18",
          "review-pastel": "#FBF0D9",
          "settled": "#0F6B45",
          "settled-pastel": "#E1F3E8",
          "overdue": "#A0331F",
          "overdue-pastel": "#FBE6E1"
        },
        "accent": {
          "DEFAULT": "#35D48A",
          "hover": "#1F9C4F"
        }
      },
      "fontFamily": {
        "display": ["var(--font-ui)", "ui-sans-serif", "system-ui", "sans-serif"],
        "sans": ["var(--font-ui)", "ui-sans-serif", "system-ui", "sans-serif"],
        "num": ["var(--font-money)", "ui-sans-serif", "system-ui", "sans-serif"],
        "mono": ["var(--font-machine)", "ui-monospace", "monospace"]
      },
      "fontSize": {
        "display-xl": ["4rem", { "lineHeight": "1.02", "letterSpacing": "-0.03em", "fontWeight": "400" }],
        "display": ["2.5rem", { "lineHeight": "1.05", "letterSpacing": "-0.02em", "fontWeight": "400" }],
        "title": ["1.75rem", { "lineHeight": "1.15", "letterSpacing": "-0.015em", "fontWeight": "400" }],
        "metric": ["1.375rem", { "lineHeight": "1.2", "letterSpacing": "-0.01em", "fontWeight": "400" }],
        "metric-sm": ["1.25rem", { "lineHeight": "1.2", "letterSpacing": "-0.01em", "fontWeight": "400" }],
        "body": ["0.875rem", { "lineHeight": "1.5", "letterSpacing": "0" }],
        "aux": ["0.75rem", { "lineHeight": "1.5", "letterSpacing": "0" }],
        "micro": ["0.6875rem", { "lineHeight": "1.3", "letterSpacing": "0.09em" }]
      },
      "fontWeight": {
        "normal": "400",
        "medium": "500"
      },
      "letterSpacing": {
        "micro": "0.09em",
        "display": "-0.02em",
        "display-xl": "-0.03em"
      },
      "borderRadius": {
        "card": "16px",
        "control": "10px",
        "field": "10px",
        "rail": "14px",
        "mini": "12px",
        "pill": "9999px"
      },
      "borderWidth": {
        "hairline": "1px"
      },
      "spacing": {
        "nav": "52px",
        "nav-gap": "6px",
        "icon": "18px",
        "icon-sm": "14px",
        "card-pad": "20px",
        "card-gap": "12px",
        "sidebar": "228px"
      },
      "boxShadow": {
        "none": "none",
        "card": "0 1px 2px rgba(18, 20, 15, 0.04)"
      },
      "opacity": {
        "hatch": "0.35"
      }
    }
  },
  "usage": {
    "accent": "acento (#35D48A) so em dois papeis: confirmacao em movimento (pulso) e botao de acao com IA/automacao. Nunca fundo de area grande, nunca botao primario (isso e sempre tinta).",
    "semantic": "Pastel de estado e nomeado pelo ESTADO DO PROCESSO (aberto/analise/liquidado/atraso), nunca bom/ruim generico — nao existe verde-positivo/vermelho-negativo arbitrario. Ver DESIGN.md.",
    "elevation": "Hierarquia vem da escada canvas -> panel -> card, reforcada por uma sombra muito sutil (shadow-card) — nao e elevacao dramatica.",
    "typeScale": "Salto binario: micro (11px caps, tracking 0.09em) ou display (40px+). Evitar tamanhos intermediarios em titulos.",
    "typography": "font-num (Inter, tabular) para dinheiro/metrica; font-sans (Schibsted Grotesk) para interface/prosa; font-mono (Geist Mono) para E2E/data/timestamp/rotulo/status."
  }
}
